(woman sighing)
- Oh fine, forget it.

00:11:33.659 --> 00:11:35.453
- Yes. I mean, okay.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:43.113
- Will you at least promise
to go see my mom every day?

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.723
- So zero pornography. Done.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.840
I like that.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:53.169
Nurse! Fix my wife!

00:11:53.169 --> 00:11:55.669
(man sobbing)

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.003
Don't touch me right now.

00:12:01.821 --> 00:12:03.121
This is not all about you.

00:12:04.396 --> 00:12:07.813
(haunting ambient music)

00:12:11.082 --> 00:12:11.915
(fingers snapping)

00:12:11.915 --> 00:12:13.170
- First things first.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.210
I do not care that you are

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:18.090
a multi-platinum selling rapper, Gun Rack.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:18.990
What I care about is that

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:22.140
I 100% know that you
murdered Darnell Simmons.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.583
So you better start talking.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.420
- Yeah, but you ain't got nothin'.

00:12:33.639 --> 00:12:34.994
- Okay.
(Detective chuckling)

00:12:34.994 --> 00:12:38.820
You know, I'm actually, I'm
very glad that you said that

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:42.788
because respectfully, I beg to differ.

00:12:42.788 --> 00:12:44.609
(hip-hop music)

00:12:44.609 --> 00:12:47.737
♪ I killed Darnell, yeah,
I shot him with my nine ♪

00:12:47.737 --> 00:12:51.467
♪ I shot him nine times,
9:00 PM on the dime ♪

00:12:51.467 --> 00:12:54.412
♪ And by the way, it was November 9th ♪

00:12:54.412 --> 00:12:56.092
(pause button clicking)

00:12:56.092 --> 00:12:59.509
(haunting ambient music)

00:13:01.394 --> 00:13:03.561
- That don't mean nothing.

00:13:05.173 --> 00:13:08.020
I got a vivid imagination.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:08.853
(Detective chuckling dryly)

00:13:08.853 --> 00:13:11.340
I couldn't have shot Darnell.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:13.953
I was at my cousin's birthday party,

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.953
Red Lobster, November 9th.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.170
- At Red Lobster?

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.010
- Mm-hmm.

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.750
- Geez, I gotta tell you, Gun Rack,

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.543
I find that really hard to believe.

00:13:25.552 --> 00:13:28.672
♪ I got an alibi, birthday, Red Lobster ♪

00:13:28.672 --> 00:13:32.719
♪ When in reality I shot
Darnell like a monster ♪

00:13:32.719 --> 00:13:33.855
♪ It's a lie ♪

00:13:33.855 --> 00:13:36.055
♪ Anyone could tell
this if you know about ♪

00:13:36.055 --> 00:13:39.870
♪ My allergy to all shellfish ♪

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.000
Just confess, Gun Rack.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.550
- I confess that shellfish is

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.750
the only thing that
rhymes with "tell this."

00:13:48.495 --> 00:13:50.745
It's just words, Detective.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:54.190
Nouns, adjectives.

00:13:55.053 --> 00:13:58.620
They just happen to be in a dope order.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.900
But you ain't got no proof.

00:14:03.946 --> 00:14:06.848
♪ Shot up Darnell with a long ass gun ♪

00:14:06.848 --> 00:14:09.914
♪ And tossed it into the aquarium ♪

00:14:09.914 --> 00:14:11.852
(hip-hop music)

00:14:11.852 --> 00:14:12.685
(button clicking)

00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:14.354
I have no idea what that object is.

00:14:14.354 --> 00:14:15.210
(Detective sighing frustratedly)

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.580
If I had to identify it,

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:22.560
I would call it a gun
of the long-ass variety.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:24.090
Some seaweed in there too.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:28.242
Look, Detective, I hate
to break it to you.

00:14:28.242 --> 00:14:29.909
I ain't kill nobody.

00:14:31.191 --> 00:14:32.688
(play button clicking)
(hip-hop music)

00:14:32.688 --> 00:14:35.546
♪ Stroke my chin reel
slow when I'm lyin' ♪

00:14:35.546 --> 00:14:38.847
♪ And I was laughing super
hard as Darnell was dyin' ♪

00:14:38.847 --> 00:14:43.620
- The name of the album is
"I Killed Darnell Simmons."

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.453
- It's a concept album.

00:14:44.453 --> 00:14:45.510
- [Detective] A concept?!

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.010
That's a picture of you.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:51.250
A picture of you, and behind
you is Darnell Simmons's body.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:55.469
(suspenseful music crescendoing)

00:14:55.469 --> 00:14:56.550
- Coincidence.

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:58.800
- You're going away for a
long time, you understand?

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:01.140
You're gonna confess if it's
the last thing you ever do.

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.783
You hear me, Gun Rack?
I'll beat it outta you!

00:15:02.783 --> 00:15:04.199
(supervisor shouting)
(detective shouting)

00:15:04.199 --> 00:15:07.366
(supervisor shouting)

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.447
- He's free to go.

00:15:11.447 --> 00:15:14.010
- What? No, no, no, we
have everything we need.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.390
- No, it was Simmons's girlfriend.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.400
She just confessed to the whole thing.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.593
Infidelity. Crime of passion.

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:21.830
Let's go, Mr. Rack.

00:15:23.001 --> 00:15:26.668
(suspenseful ambient music)

00:15:36.997 --> 00:15:37.856
(hip-hop music)

00:15:37.856 --> 00:15:39.213
♪ Bonus track, bonus track ♪

00:15:39.213 --> 00:15:40.922
♪ I got a ride or die bitch ♪

00:15:40.922 --> 00:15:42.692
♪ I think you get the gist ♪

00:15:42.692 --> 00:15:46.012
♪ And when you let me out,
I'm gonna blow a little kiss ♪

00:15:46.012 --> 00:15:47.554
♪ This is my confession ♪

00:15:47.554 --> 00:15:49.222
♪ Admissible in court ♪

00:15:49.222 --> 00:15:52.089
♪ I killed Darnell Simmons for sport ♪

00:15:52.089 --> 00:15:54.136
♪ Haha, that's right ♪

00:15:54.136 --> 00:15:56.204
♪ I'm a murderer, come get me ♪

00:15:56.204 --> 00:15:57.940
♪ Come down the hall, you can't get me. ♪

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:00.480
Okay, okay, you got me. You got me.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.165
Hey, whoa whoa, damn damn, chill! Ow, ow!

00:16:03.165 --> 00:16:07.906
(upbeat percussive theme music)

00:16:07.906 --> 00:16:12.239
♪ Oh I want ya, but I don't need ya ♪

